<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-10-13T07:53:43.104Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:53:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Myanmar military is expanding its shadow banking network to move billions abroad while bypassing its own banks, and it hosted a delegation in Sri Lanka for talks. The junta intensified airstrikes in Rakhine, launched People’s Military Service Training Batch-29, reshuffled key regional commanders and the defence minister, and rearrested 20 political prisoners released in Arakan State. Houthis warned the United States not to join a Saudi military campaign, and attacks in Rakhine continue to block Rohingya returns, while an airstrike damaged a historic Buddhist meditation centre. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNQTVpZE5UV1AyRTlYMkZQSEdEVjRDR3RmQzQ4YjdESm1EQkZDSjJYVGxRZ0VPNXAtQkxQSXRSUndtTmoyTEZaWnBiYXU0NXdVbFZ2ZzItOFBFcDktX1dpM0Uta2VxUTB6WWZJN2I0V2xyMmZJQ1JvM01CY29IUUhoZFRYaC13N2h0bWF1MHVjWTNZWDZONWNvMjM1WDVLa2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPVmxzZS1MalRNRE5OOW9wVHVtMEROTWFHdHQ0SnZpOEJaRTNCVmVaZkxaTlI4RzdENTg5OWhEMUtNNjI5b18tQWNjQ2prcjc1YVdIQ3FTS01FUVRpWVV4OGJZR2lka1puem82a0t6NWlRYVBUM2F5czRwTmFYTXVLT2U1SFNvZUd0NlAxRGZPZEJPSDN0MWlmNmJrNGFGUFlQS0g4Y1J2aWJyUk1ORlJrdXJsWTVqby1lWXhWYQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNMzkzT0s5ZXp3d0d0ZmRSUkx1VG1mUmhfdU5jUVQ2UU0waVZuLVRVVGRiT2JwekpzRDBqX0p6bDdvM2FKdTVGRU5HSkZyc2hDdDRXbUJaajdYcGk5Uk1aaUxTRVlLX1lYNjExTEpDdzVrTFdsRGtxLUJ1NGZoRHBoNTRIQ1lTX191aUx6RXU2amI4cWduSEh3YUlUQldJVW44?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE81cUwzVENRMVE0LTFSc1BCcXZ5UHZaZ09Ya18xYlhyY0w4TmNkQXlMSHdidE5PbzhuZUZ6VWs3eGNxckdTSzk5UzFwRUZIaUtVdHV1clN1REVXQ1hMOXc?o